WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Deepavali, half a world away from Chennai.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.256
Swaad makes Mysore pak, adhirasam and the whole sweet counter, in small batches in Chennai.

00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:14.200
Murukku twisted by hand, ribbon pakoda, and the mixture that disappears first.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.515
Karupatti halwa: palm jaggery, slow-stirred in ghee until it holds a clean cut.

00:00:19.515 --> 00:00:25.200
Every festival has an order-by date, worked out from each item's kitchen lead time.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:32.737
Buying for the family? Six or more of one item takes five percent off that line, up to fifteen.

00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:38.052
And the Monthly Podi Box: four jars a month, never the same four.

00:00:38.052 --> 00:00:43.367
One hundred and one things you miss from home, shipped across the US.

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:46.967
Swaad. The whole South Indian counter, shipped.
